<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh Aug copper output 20,300 T vs 24,700 July.</title>
<headline>Kazakh Aug copper output 20,300 T vs 24,700 July.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakh copper output dropped to 20,300 tonnes in August from 24,700 tonnes in July, a fall of 17.8 percent, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures for non-ferrous metals production - (all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>				Aug    July   Jan-Aug 1996 Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p> Copper		   20,300  24,700	196,000	 n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/Mth pct change   -17.8    +8.7	    n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/Yr pct change     -17.2   +16.9	  +20.1	-5.0</p>
<p> Zinc		     14,000  13,600	109,600	 n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/Mth pct change    +2.6    +4.4	    n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/Yr pct change     -11.2   +14.3	   -6.6     +10.0</p>
<p> Lead			6,500   6,500	 45,100	 n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/Mth pct change	 0	 0	    n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/Yr pct change     -11.2    -0.9	  -33.9     -30.0</p>
<p> Bauxite		 313,000 317,600    1,887,600	 n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/Mth pct change    -1.8    +0.2	    n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/Yr pct change	-6.2    +1.7	   +0.9     +16.0</p>
<p> Alumina		  94,000  94,000	713,400	 n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/Mth pct change	 0    +8.4	    n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/Yr pct change     +10.4    +8.2	   +6.1     +21.0</p>
<p> Titanium		  1,100   1,000	  7,800	 n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/Mth pct change    +4.4   -10.8	    n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/Yr pct change     +23.4   +26.3	  +31.5    +137.0</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
